      "updated": 1795783116143,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Red: new upstream snapd interface or ask. * = provider or consumer inferred, not stated in target-architecture.md. ↺ within layer: interfaces between snaps of the same layer.\nThe Driver assistant installs optional pc-kernel components (NVIDIA) after login, with admin consent.\n",
      "originalText": "Red: new upstream snapd interface or ask. * = provider or consumer inferred, not stated in target-architecture.md. ↺ within layer: interfaces between snaps of the same layer.\nThe Driver assistant installs optional pc-kernel components (NVIDIA) after login, with admin consent.\n",
